    "detailed_description": "Summon Masks is a competitive game, which we have 14 Masks in each side of a circle, take a side and push the enemy out of that circle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Objective: To push 6 enemy masks out of the mark.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRules:<br />\r\nEach player can move 1, 2 or 3 Masks at the same time on a line, at any direction, only one step.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen a player has more Masks then the enemy in a row (without blanc space between them), he can push the enemy Masks.",
